review_comments.body:
`unix.Renameat` returns a bare errno, so a failed publish now logs `link object in namespace: no such file or directory` without either path (`MoveFile`'s `os.Rename` named both). Wrap it the way `link()` wraps its O_PATH open:
return &os.LinkError{Op: "renameat", Old: tempname, New: objPath, Err: err}
`errors.Is` still sees the errno, so `isParentDirGone` and `publishErr` keep working.
